      "category": "speeds_feeds",
      "tip_text": "Standard carbide speeds: SFM 300-600 depending on alloy hardness",
      "detail": "Low-carbon (1018, 1045): SFM 500-600. Medium alloy (4140, 4340 annealed): SFM 350-450. Pre-hardened (28-32 HRC): SFM 250-350.",
