      "material": "steel",
      "category": "tooling",
      "tip_text": "Use TiCN or TiAlN coated carbide for general steel machining",
      "detail": "TiCN is good for general purpose. TiAlN handles higher temperatures for harder steels. AlCrN for high-performance applications.",
