      "material": "steel",
      "category": "general",
      "tip_text": "Monitor chip color — silver is ideal, blue/purple indicates excessive heat",
      "detail": "Chip color is a real-time temperature indicator. Silver/tan = good. Brown = getting warm. Blue = too hot, reduce speed.",
